{
  "_comment": "The run spec. Run `node run.js --corpus corpus.json`. Top-level defaults apply unless an article overrides langs/runs. Grow `articles` to the stratified ~120 (content type x source tier x language x author type) per methodology Part 1; these two are the pilot seed.",
